<title>RUSSIA: Rouble falls to 3,639 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble falls to 3,639 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble fell to 3,639 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,623 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 6		  Sept 5</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,639		   3,623</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    2.09		    3.04</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
